1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 15=

4
00:00:47,679 --> 00:00:48,759
Aren't you afraid of dying?

5
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:50,240
You still came back to save me.

6
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,479
Don't say anything.

7
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:53,880
Focus on recovering.

8
00:00:54,359 --> 00:00:55,759
Don't go anywhere for now.

9
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:00,799
Haotian.

10
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,159
That person...

11
00:01:02,719 --> 00:01:03,359
You two...

12
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:06,879
I shouldn't have asked.

13
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:10,439
It's just that I can tell

14
00:01:11,879 --> 00:01:13,400
I wasn't their target.

15
00:01:14,159 --> 00:01:14,959
You were.

16
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,200
They spent so much time planning this

17
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,359
just to bring you down.

18
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:19,439
What are you trying to say?

19
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,319
She's not simple.

20
00:01:22,005 --> 00:01:24,044
That woman is definitely not ordinary.

21
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,599
She's been watching us from the shadows.

22
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,159
We need to be careful.

23
00:01:32,879 --> 00:01:35,599
I'm afraid she'll find out
I took Jiang Lai's kidney.

24
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,359
Haotian.

25
00:01:39,959 --> 00:01:41,280
When we examined Jiang Lai back then...

26
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:43,480
She signed the voluntary
donation agreement.

27
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,560
It's in black and white.

28
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:46,959
A legitimate contract.

29
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,599
But if they dig deeper...

30
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:51,439
How did we get that first six million?

31
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:54,840
Organ trafficking is a serious crime.

32
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,680
We could go to prison.

33
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,719
Not to mention you're already carrying

34
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,040
so many investors' funds.

35
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,439
If this blows up,

36
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,480
we're both finished.

37
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,519
Listen,

38
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:04,280
you've really lost your mind from fear.

39
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,439
Zhao Mai was plotting against us
in secret before,

40
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,599
so we were caught off guard.

41
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,439
But with Jiang Lai's case,

42
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,360
we have the agreement. We'll be fine.

43
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,680
You forgot that?

44
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,039
Haotian.

45
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:16,759
Enough.

46
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:18,560
Stop scaring yourself.

47
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,439
You need to deal with your wounds.

48
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:25,879
My wounds...

49
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,400
will come in handy.

50
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:37,159
Zhao Mai!

51
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,960
Zhao Mai!

52
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,439
Zhao Mai!

53
00:02:47,815 --> 00:02:50,183
♪I should forget you♪

54
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,479
Didn't you ask me

55
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:54,000
about my past with Zhang Haotian?

56
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,520
I'll tell you now.

57
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:57,840
I don't want to know anymore.

58
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:03,080
I met him when I was sixteen.

59
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,479
I fell for him.

60
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:08,439
But he never returned my feelings.

61
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,159
It's okay now.

62
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,599
No matter what happened,

63
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,080
I believe

64
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:19,800
it was never your fault.

65
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,840
Zhang Haotian was the one who hurt you.

66
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,159
He hurt me too.

67
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,680
I know what that feels like.

68
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:28,879
You...

69
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:31,439
don't have to tear open your wounds
for me.

70
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,680
I made dinner.

71
00:03:35,039 --> 00:03:36,599
Let's go home and eat, okay?

72
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,280
Come on.

73
00:03:42,919 --> 00:03:44,240
We're best friends, right?

74
00:03:46,959 --> 00:03:52,431
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

75
00:03:53,261 --> 00:03:58,928
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

76
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,360
How did you know

77
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,879
where I was?

78
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,240
I asked Ms. Lang.

79
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,199
She told me

80
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,520
that you'd like to go there

81
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,879
if you feel unhappy.

82
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,560
So I went there to find you.

83
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:15,400
Next time you're upset,
don't come there.

84
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,439
Come find me.

85
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,079
I'll always be here.

86
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:25,564
♪Only then will the tears stop falling♪

87
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:41,279
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

88
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,759
Are you free tomorrow?

89
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,959
There's something important I want to
talk with you.

90
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:45,920
What?

91
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,800
Are you trying to use me again
to make Lin Lulu jealous?

92
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,839
What if I told you

93
00:04:52,319 --> 00:04:53,800
I really do like you?

94
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,759
I've never felt

95
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:57,120
what it's like to be in love.

96
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,279
Would you believe me?

97
00:04:58,839 --> 00:04:59,560
Yes.

98
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,480
Divorce Lin Lulu,

99
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,959
and I'll believe you immediately.

100
00:05:03,399 --> 00:05:04,199
Just wait.

101
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,519
(Zhang Haotian.)

102
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:15,639
(You won't really start chasing Zhao Ke,
will you?)

103
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,480
(I'm looking forward to it.)

104
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:20,199
(I can't wait to see
your sincerity crushed.)

105
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,720
Honey.

106
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:34,519
Baby.

107
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:36,519
Honey.

108
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,240
You...

109
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:40,639
Who are you?

110
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,040
I'm definitely not your husband.

111
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,079
Why are you here?

112
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:45,240
Get out! Get out!

113
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,319
Get down!

114
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,439
- Get down!
- Lulu!

115
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:48,639
Get down!

116
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:49,199
Get down now!

117
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,959
Haotian! Haotian!

118
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:52,920
It's not what you think.

119
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,040
Let me explain.

120
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,800
I don't know him, Haotian.

121
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,680
I know your mother's death
has been hard on you,

122
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,519
but you can't

123
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,279
bring a man home...

124
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,959
And on our wedding bed?

125
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:05,720
Did you ever think about how I feel?

126
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,240
It's not like that.

127
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,279
I... Haotian...

128
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:09,360
I really didn't.

129
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,360
It's not like that.

130
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,040
Lulu.

131
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,600
Maybe we should take some time apart.

132
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,040
No, please don't.

133
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:17,240
Haotian! Haotian!

134
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,040
Who sent you to frame me?

135
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,879
So, did you sleep well?

136
00:06:34,199 --> 00:06:35,040
Not bad.

137
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,720
What are you drawing?

138
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:41,800
I want to design

139
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,279
a dance costume for my competition.

140
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,040
But

141
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,920
look here.

142
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:48,040
Something about it doesn't feel right.

143
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,959
Is there anything you like doing?

144
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:54,680
Me?

145
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,079
I guess I like drawing.

146
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,199
Me? Really?

147
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,639
Please teach me.

148
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,560
Look here.

149
00:07:18,199 --> 00:07:19,319
Add some red.

150
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,639
Wouldn't it look better?

151
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,800
Impressive, Ms. Zhao.

152
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:25,360
Ever since I first met you,

153
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,639
I've always thought

154
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:29,399
your taste is impeccable.

155
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:30,199
Truly one of a kind.

156
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:31,319
The best!

157
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,920
Since I'm the best,

158
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,000
then I'll...

159
00:07:37,439 --> 00:07:38,519
paint on you!

160
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:45,759
(I thought I was the only one
stuck in the pain of the past,)

161
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:47,160
(unable to break free.)

162
00:07:47,399 --> 00:07:49,360
(But it turns out this girl,)

163
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:51,720
(who always seemed so brave
and resolute, walking forward with me,)

164
00:07:52,439 --> 00:07:55,879
(was also hiding a scar
deep within her heart.)

165
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,000
(We'll join forces)

166
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,879
(to tear away all the darkness
and pain,)

167
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,560
(and find the passion we once had.)

168
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:07,399
(We'll save each other,)

169
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:10,720
(and heal our broken selves.)

170
00:08:17,753 --> 00:08:19,753
(United)

171
00:08:20,411 --> 00:08:24,509
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

172
00:08:25,317 --> 00:08:28,129
♪I should forget you♪

173
00:08:28,598 --> 00:08:33,675
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

174
00:08:33,699 --> 00:08:35,539
♪To carry on♪

175
00:08:35,795 --> 00:08:40,652
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

176
00:08:41,018 --> 00:08:42,906
♪You no longer have the strength♪

177
00:08:45,205 --> 00:08:48,086
♪You want me to go there for you♪

178
00:08:49,654 --> 00:08:55,092
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

179
00:08:55,686 --> 00:08:58,825
♪Your freedom♪

180
00:08:59,525 --> 00:09:03,956
♪Has become my cage♪

181
00:09:04,884 --> 00:09:10,675
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

182
00:09:12,026 --> 00:09:17,876
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

183
00:09:18,339 --> 00:09:24,286
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

184
00:09:24,566 --> 00:09:27,816
♪You told me♪

185
00:09:28,213 --> 00:09:32,719
♪I would shine like a star♪

186
00:09:33,563 --> 00:09:38,000
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

187
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,760
♪How to live without you♪

188
00:09:41,979 --> 00:09:47,804
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

189
00:09:49,325 --> 00:09:53,109
♪So hazy and blurred♪
